                                                 "content":  "\u003ch3\u003eDocumentation\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e MDN web docs - \u003ca href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Statements/import\"\u003e\u003ccode\u003eimport\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/a\u003e \u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eRelated rules\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e \u003ca href=\u0027/coding_rules#rule_key=javascript%3AS1481\u0027\u003eS1481\u003c/a\u003e - Unused local variables and functions should be removed \u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e"
                                             }
